WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.163
Welcome to the White Cell Support orientation.

00:00:03.163 --> 00:00:07.475
Maintain the authoritative exercise clock, review queues, communications

00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:10.875
, specialist workflow, and auditable session record without weakening

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:12.262
role boundaries.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:14.688
Work through the console as an operator loop:

00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:17.762
verify shared state, inspect the owning queue, make

00:00:17.762 --> 00:00:21.175
an explicit decision, communicate it to the intended audience

00:00:21.175 --> 00:00:23.225
, and confirm the audit trail.

00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:26.538
Lead and Support must follow the permissions actually exposed to

00:00:26.538 --> 00:00:27.488
their seats;

00:00:27.488 --> 00:00:29.775
visibility never grants authority.
